<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Arcane Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 3 Pre-Raid. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, professions, boe gear and reputation rewards.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Arcane Mage DPS in Phase 3</span></h2>There's some changes to how stats work in cataclysm and a new stat as well, because of this your priorities change a bit as well, but because of reforging it makes it easier to pick and choose how much of each stat you want. You'll want to use a mix of <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a> for red socket and items with bad socket bonuses, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52205/artful-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Artful Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Artful Ember Topaz</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52208/reckless-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Reckless Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ember Topaz</span></a> for yellow sockets, and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52217/veiled-demonseye">
<img alt="Veiled Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Demonseye</span></a> on blue sockets to help reach hit cap.<br/>
<br/>Once you've hit the 17% hit cap, you'll aim for your soft haste cap, this is the amount of haste required to cast <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=30451/arcane-blast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_blast.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Blast</span></a> in 1 sec during the initial burn phase. You can find the required haste caps in the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve#gearing-advice">Stat Priority Guide</a>.<br/>
<br/>After you've hit the required haste cap, you'll aim for mastery as that increases the damage of your conservation phase significantly as well as your initial burst during burn phase. Critical strike rating can otherwise be ignored and reforged to the previously mentioned two.<br/>
<br/>This is a very straight forward specialization to pick items for, as well as to gem and reforge if you follow those advice.<br/>
<br/>
