<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a> will now be the best in slot pre-raid headpiece, this was best in slot in past phases and is incredibly high value item due to its increased item level compared to other items of same phase, being closer to phase 3 gear than other phase 1 and 2 gear.<br/>
<br/>While farming the previously mentioned headpiece, the engineering headpiece is recommended. The tier 11 headpiece is available but it costs the same type of currency as the 379 item level head so it'll just slow down your gear progress if you buy it.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.</div></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
