<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Although spirit is an entirely useless stat for mages, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65043/mantle-of-nefarius">
<img alt="Mantle of Nefarius" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Nefarius</span></a> is still better than other pre-raid options, mostly because of its increased stat budget from being higher item level - meaning it has more intellect. Additionally, the spirit can be partially reforged into an useful stat.<br/>
<br/>The tier shoulders are available, but similarly to the head slot, because it costs the same currency as the pre-raid best in slot, there's no point in getting it. Instead to use as a temporary upgrade to do the heroic inferno protocol dungeons, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58157/meadow-mantle">
<img alt="Meadow Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meadow Mantle</span></a> are recommended instead since they're available very early if you do a few dungeons while leveling up.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.</div></div>
