<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back">Back for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to the head slot, we now get access to a 379 item level option that was previously only available from sinestra - this is clearly the pre-raid best in slot and well worth the time investment to get since you'll use it until you get the actual phase 3 best in slot cloak later on.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
