<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist">Waist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65376/soul-breath-belt">
<img alt="Soul Breath Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Breath Belt</span></a> heroic version is now available from satchels that are bought using the currency from heroic inferno protocol dungeons, these are fairly cheap at only 28 per satchel. Sadly they drop a random suffix, so I personally recommend just settling for the first belt that has intellect and no spirit.<br/>
<br/>While farming these, the tailoring <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54503/dreamless-belt">
<img alt="Dreamless Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamless Belt</span></a> is very cheap to get, so this is recommended to get and then later upgrade with the 372 ilvl belt after buying bigger upgrades such as the 379 head and cloak.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: The following enchants can be used simultaneously:<ul class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> for an extra Gem Socket.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> if you're an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif");'>Engineer</span>.</div></li></ul></div></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
