<tr>
<td>Best</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65376/soul-breath-belt">
<img alt="Soul Breath Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Breath Belt</span></a> <span class="q4">of the Feverflare</span>
