<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to other slots where tier is obtainable before raids, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71288/firehawk-leggings">
<img alt="Firehawk Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firehawk Leggings</span></a> is the new pre-raid option. This will also be obtainable from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and can later be further upgraded into the best in slot item.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise, the previous tier 11 legs become available from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> instead. These make every other legs from the vendor irrelevant as they're just as easy to get but just better.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54448/powerful-enchanted-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Enchanted Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_eternium.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Enchanted Spellthread</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75154/masters-spellthread">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Master's Spellthread</span></a> if <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif");'>Tailor</span>.</div></div>
