<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet">Feet for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>With feet, you're aiming for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69954/boots-of-the-black-flame">
<img alt="Boots of the Black Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Black Flame</span></a>, which is the new tailoring item this phase.<br/>Otherwise, the past options remain the same in terms of ranking and performance, just worse in comparison to the previously mentioned boots.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52782/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Lavawalker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>.</div></div>
