<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Althought not as high priority as tier 12 items, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70106/nightweavers-amulet">
<img alt="Nightweaver's Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightweaver's Amulet</span></a> <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is a great purchase to get caught up with other players.<br/>
<br/>If you've already bought the actual pre-raid best in slot items from the fissure stone fragment vendor, then buying some <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69882/planetary-amulet">
<img alt="Planetary Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Amulet</span></a> satchels in hope of getting a intellect version without spirit is a valid purchase to upgrade early on since valor is limited early on.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise, just farming out the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62416/yellow-smoke-pendant">
<img alt="Yellow Smoke Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Yellow Smoke Pendant</span></a> reputation belt while farming other items is recommended to then use as a place holder in early end-game content.<div class="pad"></div>
