<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings">Rings for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>As for rings, we now aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71210/crystalline-brimstone-ring">
<img alt="Crystalline Brimstone Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_01b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystalline Brimstone Ring</span></a> and some intellect version of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65373/planetary-band">
<img alt="Planetary Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Band</span></a>.<br/>The former requires <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> which can take a while early on while gathering other more relevant items such as tier 12 pieces.<br/>
<br/>Until you can get either of these, look at the items below them listed here.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
