<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> is by far the best pre-raid trinket you can obtain, if you have any budget put aside for pre-raid gearing, use it for this. Alongside it, the new <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65105/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> is a solid option since it's available in its heroic state from the new heroic dungeon currency vendor.<br/>
<br/>It's relevant to note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
<img alt="Moonwell Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Chalice</span></a> is time gated by the phase 3 dailies, which means it can easily be irrelevant by the time you actually get it - because of this it's mostly an irrelevant item unless you happen to have it done anyways for one reason or another.<div class="pad"></div>
