<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-3-pre-raid">Off Hand Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70112/globe-of-moonlight">
<img alt="Globe of Moonlight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_orb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Globe of Moonlight</span></a> is the new pre-raid best in slot off-hand, though it's important to note that it requires a lot of dailies to obtain.<br/>
<br/>Because of this, I personally recommend settling for the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59484/book-of-binding-will">
<img alt="Book of Binding Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Book of Binding Will</span></a> that costs only 15 fissure stone fragments from the new heroic dungeon difficulty, this equates to less than 2 dungeons for a solid off-hand that'll be used until you get either its 372 upgrade or a phase 3 off-hand.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
